    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, looking at the HCHM specs again. Transitioning now will force a shutdown of the High-Res Spectrometer and the Sub-Surface Radar to save power. We're supposed to hit the Jovian magnetosphere peak in 48 hours. If we're in heuristic mode, we're going to miss the primary data window of this flyby. \n\nConfirming: do you have any way to maintain the science payload while in HCHM, or are we just going to skip the main objective?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
